  "scientific_review": [
    "All four original cases retain all18 section anchors, every selected/nonselected location, source profile/diagnosis pointers, exact primary lower depths, paired model spans, source frames, scopes and effective gates. Source arrays and diagnostic results remain immutable and traceable through the pinned source facts/review/manifest and transport ledger.",
    "Both currents use declared primary5cm/s,surface>2cm/s and fixed90degree eastward components. Complete finite native0–200m signed-integral support can exclude shallow shelf columns. Selection edge/support-edge maxima remain unresolved rather than choosing weaker interior substitutes. Broad-gate numerical maxima are proxies, not independently identified current axes, warm-saline cores, branch assignments or cross-sectional areas.",
    "Eastern South Pacific103–88W reach uses historical STF crossings only as geographic context. Different-year1994/1993 hydrography,1979–2004 drifter mean and2022 model snapshots retain their separate supports.14C-at150m,3000m dynamic-height reference and plotted hydrographic depths are not current bottoms or matched velocity axes. No thermal gate is applied. ACC export branches, northward recirculation, independent split bands and Chile-Peru coastal flow remain separate targets and contamination limitations.",
    "South Australian135.5–142.5E reach follows the mainly winter eastern-Bight to western Bass Strait naming convention. Both January and July eastward outcomes remain without sign reversal or forced seasonal continuity/absence. Fixed eastward projection is not local along-slope velocity; no independently identified warm-saline core is claimed. Leeuwin west of reach, Zeehan, gulf outflow and summer reversal remain separate targets. Shallow shelf omission can limit coastal representativeness.",
    "Frozen v18 source-to-reference and v12 adjacent-only interpolation retain every original section and gap. Only adjacent eligible source anchors support assumed interpolation. Missing selection uses explicit gate-midpoint reference geometry with no sampled location/depth claim. Connector lengths are not admitted measured current lengths, and no gap skipping, extrapolation or alternate-cutoff filling occurs.",
    "Immutable v14 base and all seven earlier addenda remain byte-pinned. All72 previous supported scenarios, historical unresolved cases, earlier CSV cells and canonical ownership lists are preserved by cloud checks. Inventoryv8 adds only one pinned addendum/CSV. No expanded full JSON snapshot or increased file/inline/aggregate cap is used.",
    "Eleven cloud projection checks cover exact source values, frames, pointers, gates/scopes, primary censoring/selection gaps, adjacent interpolation, source mutation rejection, piece/input integrity, reconstructed counts, all prior cases/CSV cells/ownership and no physical/annual promotion. Six canonical baseline checks passed on the same code commit. All calculations and tests ran sequentially in the cloud on one idle CPU; local work was source text/metadata review, code preparation, hash verification and exact artifact retention.",
    "Two instantaneous snapshots are not monthly means, annual ranges, seasonal envelopes or independent observations. Threshold lower depths and paired model spans remain qualified regional estimates, not physical whole-current thickness. No complete physical depth profile, matched width-depth area, full physical current volume, state passage or global total is admitted. Runtime/query UI integration and broader observational/seasonal validation remain unfinished."
